    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37026" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ponto</span></b> , ōnis, m.
		1. pons. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A kind of Gallic transport</i>, <i>a
				punt</i>, <i><span class="en">Caes. B. C. 3, 29</span></i>.—
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A floating bridge</i>, <i>a
			pontoon</i>, <i><span class="en">Aus. Idyll. 12, 10</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Dig.
				8, 3, 38</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Gell. 10, 25, 5</span></i>.</div>
